  callSubtitle: '<i>[Dad]</i> Hey, kiddo. Just checking in. Looks like i''m deeper
    in the old jokerville shaft then i thought. Shouldn''t take long.

    <i>[You]</i>
    You sure you are okay down there? That place hasn''t been touched in decades.

    <i>[Dad]</i>
    Don''t worry. These stories are just mountain myths. I''ll call again when I''m
    heading up

    <i>[Dad]</i> Wait what was that sound.




    <i>[You]</i> Dad?
    Dad!? Hello!? Can you hear me?!'
